pan><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-background/35\"></span><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-background/35\"></span><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-background/35\"></span><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-background/35\"></span><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-background/35\"></span></span></div><div class=\"mt-3 px-1\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary\">Sage Vellum</p><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] text-foreground/55\">#3E5C4A</p></div><p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Tonal support · borders</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-accent font-medium\" style=\"opacity:0\">PMS 5605 C<!-- --> · print-safe · CMYK fallback available</p></div></article></div></div></div></section><section id=\"committee\" class=\"py-20 md:py-28 bg-secondary/50 border-y border-primary/10\"><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px]\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-30px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Section 04 · The Selection Committee</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-primary text-balance\">A small committee that reads the way good editors used to read.</h2><p class=\"mt-6 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/70 text-pretty\">Our curation is steered by Prof Stephen, alongside literary specialists, academic minds, and cultural curators. The committee reviews hundreds of independent titles each year to find the rare few that meet our standard for intellectual depth.</p><div class=\"mt-8 rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-card p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-14 w-14 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-serif text-xl font-semibold\">PS</span><div><p class=\"font-serif text-lg font-semibold text-primary\">Prof Stephen</p><p class=\"text-sm text-foreground/65\">Selection Committee Chair, STEVEREADERCLUB</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 grid gap-6 md:gap-8\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[5/4] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-secondary/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><img alt=\"Prof Stephen, Selection Committee Chair, at the reading desk\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover grayscale-[5%] contrast-[1.05]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/brand/prof-stephen.png\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-primary/15 pointer-events-none\"></div><figcaption class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/85 font-medium\"><span>Plate I</span><span>The Chair · Reading Desk</span></figcaption></div><div class=\"rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-card p-7 md:p-9\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-5 w-5 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">How We Operate</p></div><h3 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-primary leading-tight text-balance\">An independent society, transparent about its structure.</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/75\">STEVEREADERCLUB operates as an independent private literary society. We are transparent about our structure. Our community is built on mutual respect and intellectual rigor, not commercial pay-to-play marketing. We fund our distribution and engagement programs through our private network, so selection criteria stay focused on literary merit.</p><div class=\"mt-7 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-sm bg-secondary/50 p-4 border border-primary/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-5 w-5 text-primary mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Independent funding</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-0.5 leading-snug\">Private network, not author fees.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-sm bg-secondary/50 p-4 border border-primary/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-5 w-5 text-primary mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Merit-based selection</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-0.5 leading-snug\">No commercial pressure.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-sm bg-secondary/50 p-4 border border-primary/10\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-5 w-5 text-primary mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Capped intake</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-0.5 leading-snug\">15 authors per annual cycle.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 md:py-28\"><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px]\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-b border-primary/15 pb-5 mb-10 md:mb-14\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Voices From the Hub</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-primary text-balance\">What authors and readers say after a cycle in the salon.</h2></div><p class=\"hidden md:block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Three of the cycle</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8\"><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-card p-7 md:p-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote h-7 w-7 text-accent/70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-lg md:text-xl leading-snug text-primary text-pretty\">The depth of discussion generated around my book was staggering. STEVEREADERCLUB did not just give me readers, they gave my work a legacy, treating the text with a level of consideration that is incredibly rare in the modern publishing landscape.</p><div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-primary/15\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Residency Alumnus</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-0.5\">Independent Author</p></div></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-card p-7 md:p-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote h-7 w-7 text-accent/70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-lg md:text-xl leading-snug text-primary text-pretty\">In a sea of surface-level internet commentary, this salon is a sanctuary. The discussions are consistently high-signal, challenging, and deeply rewarding. I have read more carefully this year than I have in a decade.</p><div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-primary/15\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Core Salon Member</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-0.5\">Reader, Lagos Hub</p></div></article><article class=\"flex flex-col rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-card p-7 md:p-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-quote h-7 w-7 text-accent/70\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M5 3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2 1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a1 1 0 0 0 1 1 6 6 0 0 0 6-6V5a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-lg md:text-xl leading-snug text-primary text-pretty\">Prof Stephen and the committee read the way good editors used to read. They understand that a book is not a product, it is a record of someone thinking. That posture changes the entire conversation.</p><div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-primary/15\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Residency Alumnus</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-0.5\">Independent Author</p></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"talks\" class=\"py-20 md:py-28 bg-secondary/50 border-y border-primary/10\"><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px]\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-b border-primary/15 pb-5 mb-10 md:mb-14\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Section 05 · Lectures &amp; Talks</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-primary text-balance\">Recorded sessions, played in place.</h2></div><p class=\"hidden md:block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Embedded · no external player</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8\"><article class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-primary/5 group\"><video src=\"/brand/talk-01.mp4\" poster=\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/41435ee830f1.jpg\" preload=\"none\" playsInline=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover grayscale-[10%] contrast-[1.05]\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-primary/15 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/85 font-medium pointer-events-none\"><span>L01<!-- --> · <!-- -->2024</span><span>5 min preview</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\" aria-label=\"Start video\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/85 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary border border-primary/25 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-primary-foreground group-hover:border-accent transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-6 w-6 translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-primary/15 pt-3\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">L01<!-- --> · <!-- -->2024</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary leading-snug text-balance\">Reading Slowly in a Year of Acceleration</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed\">Prof Stephen, with the cycle readers</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Annual Opening Lecture · Lagos Hub</p></div></article><article class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-primary/5 group\"><video src=\"/brand/talk-01.mp4\" poster=\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/0705fc51fae4.jpg\" preload=\"none\" playsInline=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover grayscale-[10%] contrast-[1.05]\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-primary/15 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/85 font-medium pointer-events-none\"><span>L02<!-- --> · <!-- -->2023</span><span>5 min preview</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\" aria-label=\"Start video\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/85 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary border border-primary/25 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-primary-foreground group-hover:border-accent transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-6 w-6 translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-primary/15 pt-3\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">L02<!-- --> · <!-- -->2023</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary leading-snug text-balance\">On Margins: Annotation as a Form of Reading</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed\">Committee Salon, with Residency Authors</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Salon Series · Vol. IV</p></div></article><article class=\"flex flex-col\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-sm bg-primary/5 group\"><video src=\"/brand/talk-01.mp4\" poster=\"https://z-cdn.chatglm.cn/image-search-mcp/images-ppt/5d3f1242397f.jpg\" preload=\"none\" playsInline=\"\" muted=\"\" loop=\"\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover grayscale-[10%] contrast-[1.05]\"></video><div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-primary/15 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 right-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary-foreground/85 font-medium pointer-events-none\"><span>L03<!-- --> · <!-- -->2023</span><span>5 min preview</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\" aria-label=\"Start video\"><span class=\"inline-flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-background/85 backdrop-blur-sm text-primary border border-primary/25 group-hover:bg-accent group-hover:text-primary-foreground group-hover:border-accent transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-play h-6 w-6 translate-x-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon points=\"6 3 20 12 6 21 6 3\"></polygon></svg></span></button></div><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-primary/15 pt-3\"><p class=\"font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">L03<!-- --> · <!-- -->2023</p><h3 class=\"mt-1 font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl font-semibold text-primary leading-snug text-balance\">The Quiet Atlas: A Closing Conversation</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed\">Residency Alumnus in conversation with Prof Stephen</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Cycle Close · Members Only</p></div></article></div><p class=\"mt-12 text-center text-xs text-foreground/55 italic max-w-xl mx-auto\">Members receive the unedited recordings by post at the close of each cycle, alongside a printed transcript set in Playfair.</p></div></section><section class=\"py-20 md:py-28\"><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px]\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-b border-primary/15 pb-5 mb-10 md:mb-14\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Colophon · Est. MMXVIII</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-primary text-balance\">Seven years of slow reading.</h2></div><p class=\"hidden md:block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">2018 → present</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-4\"><div class=\"lg:sticky lg:top-28 rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-secondary/40 p-7 md:p-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Founded</p><p class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-6xl md:text-7xl font-semibold text-primary leading-none\">2018</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-foreground/65 leading-relaxed\">Above a bookshop in Lagos, with twelve readers and a single handwritten page of rules.</p><div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-primary/15\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award h-5 w-5 text-accent mb-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15.477 12.89 1.515 8.526a.5.5 0 0 1-.81.47l-3.58-2.687a1 1 0 0 0-1.197 0l-3.586 2.686a.5.5 0 0 1-.81-.469l1.514-8.526\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-primary\">Independent funding since day one</p><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 mt-1 leading-snug\">No author has ever paid for selection, review, or placement. Not in seven years. Not ever.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-8\"><ol class=\"relative border-l-2 border-primary/20 ml-3\"><li class=\"relative pl-8 pb-10 last:pb-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-accent ring-4 ring-background\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">2018</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-primary leading-tight\">The First Salon</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/75 text-pretty\">Prof Stephen convenes the first reading circle in a borrowed office above a Lagos bookshop. Twelve readers. One book. The shape of the annual cycle is set on a single handwritten page.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 pb-10 last:pb-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-accent ring-4 ring-background\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">2020</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-primary leading-tight\">The Hub Goes Global</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/75 text-pretty\">The private channel opens to readers outside Lagos for the first time. The first Residency Alumnus publishes under the cycle banner. The review velocity benchmark emerges organically, not as a goal.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 pb-10 last:pb-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-accent ring-4 ring-background\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">2022</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-primary leading-tight\">The Selection Committee Forms</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/75 text-pretty\">Literary specialists, academic minds, and cultural curators join Prof Stephen as formal committee members. The intake is capped at fifteen standout authors per annual cycle to protect the depth of engagement.</p></li><li class=\"relative pl-8 pb-10 last:pb-0\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(-20px)\"><span class=\"absolute -left-[9px] top-1 h-4 w-4 rounded-full bg-accent ring-4 ring-background\"></span><p class=\"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">2025</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-primary leading-tight\">21,000 Members and Counting</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] md:text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/75 text-pretty\">The community passes twenty-one thousand global hub members and two thousand active salon readers. The committee still reads every submission in full. The structure has not changed since 2018.</p></li></ol></div></div></div></section><section id=\"catalog\" class=\"py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-primary/10\"><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px]\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between border-b border-primary/15 pb-5 mb-10 md:mb-14\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Section 06 · Live Catalog</p><h2 class=\"mt-2 font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-primary text-balance\">Search the open book catalog.</h2></div><p class=\"hidden md:block text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Powered by Open Library</p></div><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12 items-start\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><p class=\"text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-foreground/70 text-pretty\">Look up any book by title or author. Results pull live from the Open Library catalog — covers, editions, and the year of first publication. Anything you find here, the committee will consider for the next cycle on request.</p><form class=\"mt-6 flex gap-2\"><div class=\"relative flex-1\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-foreground/40\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg><input type=\"search\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground dark:bg-input/30 flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive pl-10 pr-9 h-12 bg-background border-primary/25 focus-visible:ring-accent\" placeholder=\"Search by title or author…\" aria-label=\"Search the book catalog\" value=\"\"/></div><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive shadow-xs py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 h-12 px-6 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90\" type=\"submit\">Search</button></form><div class=\"mt-5\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-foreground/55 font-medium mb-2\">Try one of these</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary/25 text-foreground/70 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Toni Morrison</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary/25 text-foreground/70 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Italo Calvino</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary/25 text-foreground/70 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Leo Tolstoy</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary/25 text-foreground/70 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Chimamanda Adichie</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary/25 text-foreground/70 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">George Eliot</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border transition-colors border-primary/25 text-foreground/70 hover:border-primary hover:text-primary\">Borges</button></div></div><div class=\"relative mt-8 aspect-[16/9] overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-primary/15 hidden lg:block\"><img alt=\"Open book on a wooden reading desk under warm library light\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover grayscale-[10%] contrast-[1.05]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/brand/book-search-hero.png\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 ring-1 ring-inset ring-primary/15 pointer-events-none\"></div><p class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-foreground/85 font-medium\">Plate II · The Reader&#x27;s Desk</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"rounded-sm border border-dashed border-primary/25 p-10 md:p-14 text-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open h-8 w-8 text-accent mx-auto\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-primary\">The catalog is ready when you are.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-foreground/60 max-w-md mx-auto leading-relaxed\">Search for any title or author. Results pull live from the Open Library catalog with covers and first publication years.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"connect\" class=\"py-20 md:py-32 bg-primary text-primary-foreground relative overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06]\" style=\"background-image:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 15%, #FAF7F0 0, transparent 40%), radial-gradient(circle at 20% 85%, #B0854B 0, transparent 45%)\"></div><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px] relative\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Section 07 · Connect</p><h2 class=\"mt-3 font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-primary-foreground text-balance\">Fifteen authors per cycle. Considered one at a time.</h2><p class=\"mt-5 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/75 text-pretty\">To keep our high-signal salons exceptional, we only accept 15 standout authors per annual cycle. If you are an independent author whose work aligns with our mission, submit your details below for committee consideration.</p><div class=\"mt-8 rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/20 p-5\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-accent font-semibold\">Direct line to the chair</p><a href=\"mailto:profstephenbookclub@gmail.com\" class=\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 link-underline font-serif text-xl md:text-2xl text-primary-foreground\">profstephenbookclub@gmail.com</a><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs text-primary-foreground/55 leading-relaxed\">Messages from this form land directly in the chair&#x27;s inbox. Nothing is filtered by an autoresponder.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\"><div class=\"rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 p-3\"><p class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-accent leading-none\">15</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-foreground/65 font-medium leading-snug\">Authors per cycle</p></div><div class=\"rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 p-3\"><p class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-accent leading-none\">4 wks</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-foreground/65 font-medium leading-snug\">Avg. response time</p></div><div class=\"rounded-sm border border-primary-foreground/15 p-3\"><p class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-accent leading-none\">0</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary-foreground/65 font-medium leading-snug\">Author fees, ever</p></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><form class=\"rounded-sm border border-primary/15 bg-card p-7 md:p-10 shadow-[0_30px_60px_-30px_rgba(27,58,42,0.3)]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-primary/15 pb-4 mb-6\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Author Submission · Form</p><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-foreground/55 font-medium\">Fields marked * required</p></div><h3 class=\"font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl font-semibold text-primary\">Submit your work for the next cycle.</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-foreground/70 leading-relaxed\">The chair reads every submission personally. A response may take up to four weeks during an active reading cycle. Messages route directly into the committee inbox at profstephenbookclub@gmail.com.</p><div class=\"mt-7 space-y-5\"><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary font-medium\" for=\"name\">Full name *</label><input data-slot=\"input\" class=\"file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground dark:bg-input/30 flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-background border-primary/20 focus-visible:ring-accent h-11\" id=\"name\" placeholder=\"Jane Doe\" required=\"\" name=\"name\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary font-medium\" for=\"email\">Email address *</label><input type=\"email\" data-slot=\"input\" class=\"file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground dark:bg-input/30 flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-background border-primary/20 focus-visible:ring-accent h-11\" id=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@yourdomain.com\" required=\"\" name=\"email\"/></div></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary font-medium\" for=\"bookTitle\">Book title (if available)</label><input data-slot=\"input\" class=\"file:text-foreground placeholder:text-muted-foreground selection:bg-primary selection:text-primary-foreground dark:bg-input/30 flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-md border px-3 py-1 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none file:inline-flex file:h-7 file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-sm file:font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive bg-background border-primary/20 focus-visible:ring-accent h-11\" id=\"bookTitle\" placeholder=\"The Quiet Atlas\" name=\"bookTitle\"/></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><label data-slot=\"label\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 select-none group-data-[disabled=true]:pointer-events-none group-data-[disabled=true]:opacity-50 peer-disabled:cursor-not-allowed peer-disabled:opacity-50 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary font-medium\" for=\"message\">A short note to the committee *</label><textarea data-slot=\"textarea\" class=\"placeholder:text-muted-foreground focus-visible:border-ring aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive dark:bg-input/30 flex field-sizing-content min-h-16 w-full rounded-md border px-3 py-2 text-base shadow-xs transition-[color,box-shadow] outline-none focus-visible:ring-[3px] disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 md:text-sm bg-background border-primary/20 focus-visible:ring-accent resize-none\" id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"6\" placeholder=\"Tell us about the book, where it is in its lifecycle, and why you believe it belongs in this cycle.\" required=\"\"></textarea></div></div><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-primary/15 pt-5\"><p class=\"text-xs text-foreground/60 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">By submitting, you agree to receive a single reply from Prof Stephen or the committee. We do not share, sell, or list-build with your address.</p><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive shadow-xs py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90 h-12 px-7\" type=\"submit\">Submit to the committee<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-2 h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"mt-6 pt-5 border-t border-primary/15 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"text-foreground/65\">Or write directly:</span><a href=\"mailto:profstephenbookclub@gmail.com\" class=\"link-underline font-medium text-primary\">profstephenbookclub@gmail.com</a></div></form></div></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"bg-primary text-primary-foreground\"><div class=\"container-px mx-auto max-w-[1400px] py-14 md:py-20\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 md:gap-12 md:grid-cols-12\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" aria-label=\"STEVEREADERCLUB\" href=\"#top\"><img alt=\"STEVEREADERCLUB mark\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"h-12 w-12 object-contain bg-primary-foreground/95 rounded-sm p-1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/brand/logo.png\"/><span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\"><span class=\"font-serif font-semibold tracking-tight text-primary-foreground text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Steve<span class=\"italic text-accent\">Reader</span>Club</span><span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-primary-foreground/55 font-medium\">Est. MMXVIII</span></span></a><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-primary-foreground/65 text-pretty\">An independent private literary society and curated cultural hub. We treat literature not as a temporary commodity, but as a permanent cultural contribution.</p><a href=\"mailto:profstephenbookclub@gmail.com\" class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground link-underline\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4 text-accent\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>profstephenbookclub@gmail.com</a></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">The Society</p><ul class=\"mt-4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-y-2.5 gap-x-4\"><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#manifesto\">Manifesto</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#spreads\">The Cycle</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#specimens\">Specimens</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#committee\">Committee</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#talks\">Talks</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#catalog\">Catalog</a></li><li><a class=\"text-sm text-primary-foreground/75 hover:text-primary-foreground transition-colors\" href=\"#connect\">Contact</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"md:col-span-3\"><p class=\"text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-accent font-medium\">Colophon</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-primary-foreground/65 leading-relaxed\">Set in Playfair Display and Inter. Printed on warm cream. Independent funding. Merit-based selection. Capped at fifteen standout authors per annual cycle.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-primary-foreground/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3\"><p class=\"text-xs text-primary-foreground/55\">© 2018–<!-- -->2026<!-- --> STEVEREADERCLUB. All rights reserved.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-primary-foreground/55\">A private literary society · No commercial placement · No pay-to-play</p></div></div></footer></div><!--$--><!--/$--><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></ol></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/eace5302ed9f6616.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[77855,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/f5dbffc2357b227a.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/a6850a050755d134.js\\\"],\\\"Toaster\\\"]\\n5:I[47257,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"ClientPageRoot\\\"]\\n6:I[52683,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/f5dbffc2357b227a.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/a6850a050755d134.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/70beb6f5fdd3d23a.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n9:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\na:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\n10:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/d2be314c3ece3fbe.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n: